	<name>2276 Shattuck Ave · 336 units · Entitled · loop</name>
	<description><![CDATA[Standalone building loop, generated by scripts/gen_building_loop.py. Plan view 188 m -> spiral -> 1.2 turns -> eye level 73 m at radius 82 m. Altitudes derive from this building's extrusion height (62.7 m), so a corrected height re-cuts the shot. Load alongside geometry.kml.]]></description>
